BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Beach Metro Community News
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261129T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261129T130000
DTSTAMP:20261027T124728Z
CREATED:20261026T175432Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261027T124728Z
UID:54375-1795950000-1795957200@beachmetro.com
SUMMARY:Santa Photos at DeClute Real Estate / Wright Sisters Group
DESCRIPTION:The most wonderful time of the year is almost here\, and we’re excited to bring a little extra holiday magic to The Beach! \nOur annual Santa Photo Day is back\, and we’re inviting families\, friends\, neighbours\, and clients to join us for a festive afternoon at DeClute Real Estate / Wright Sisters Group. On Sunday\, November 29th\, from 11 AM to 1 PM\, Santa will be making a special stop at our office\, ready to spread some Christmas cheer and pose for complimentary family photos! \nWhether it’s a treasured annual tradition or your little one’s very first visit with Santa\, we love being part of the memories that make this season so special. Stop by to say hello\, enjoy some delicious holiday treats\, and capture a keepsake photo to cherish for years to come. Everyone is welcome (including pets)\, and there’s no need to book an appointment! \nWhile you’re here\, be sure to explore Corbin’s Christmas Market\, which will be open during the event. Browse a wonderful selection of holiday goodies\, pick up a few gifts\, and enjoy some festive shopping right in the heart of our Beach community. \nEvent Details: \nDate: Sunday\, November 29th\nTime: 11 AM – 1 PM\nLocation: 2234 Queen Street East\nCost: Complimentary! \nThe holidays are all about coming together\, celebrating traditions\, and making memories with the people who matter most. We look forward to welcoming you and your family for a little holiday magic\, some festive fun\, and plenty of smiles! \nWe can’t wait to see you there!
URL:https://beachmetro.com/event/santa-photos-at-declute-real-estate-wright-sisters-group/
LOCATION:DeClute Real Estate and Wright Sisters Group Office\, 2234 Queen St E\, Toronto\, M4E 1G2
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://d28bcn7yu97icd.cloudfront.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/26135440/DO3A2634-scaled.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="DeClute Real Estate and Wright Sisters Group":MAILTO:info@unionrealty.ca
END:VEVENT
