SUMMARY:Sass & Spurs line dancing fundraiser in support of Centre 55’s Share A Christmas program!
DESCRIPTION:🎄🤠 HOLIDAY BOOTS\, BIG HEARTS & A WHOLE LOT OF SASS! ✨🎅\nDust off your boots\, add a little holiday sparkle\, and get ready to boot-scoot for a GREAT cause! 🎁💃\nSass & Spurs is bringing the festive fun to the dance floor for our next line dancing fundraiser in support of Centre 55’s Share A Christmas program! ❤️🎄\nWhether you’re a seasoned dancer or just here for the holiday cheer\, come kick up your heels\, spread some Christmas magic\, and make a real difference in our community. Expect high-energy music\, festive vibes\, and plenty of sass! 🤠✨
URL:https://beachmetro.com/event/sass-spurs-line-dancing-fundraiser-in-support-of-centre-55s-share-a-christmas-program/
LOCATION:Royal Canadian Legion Branch 13\, 1577 Kingston Rd.\, Scarborough\, Toronto
ORGANIZER;CN="Sass &amp%3B Spurs events":MAILTO:sassandspursevents@gmail.com
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
