SUMMARY:RCL Br. 11 & 22 Breakfast with Santa
DESCRIPTION:RCL Br 11 & 22 Breakfast with Santa at 1240 Woodbine Ave.\, 10 a.m.-12 noon (last seating 11:30 a.m.). Pancakes with or without bacon or sausages\, coffee or tea for adults and juice for the kids\, all for $5. Tickets sold at the door! Note: this is not all you can eat buffet. Kids: win a prize for the Best Ugly Christmas Sweater; take your picture with Santa; jar full of candies for $1 to guess how many candies to win. Exact or closest will win the jar of candies. Draws done at 11:30. Candy Canes for all the children.
URL:https://beachmetro.com/event/rcl-br-11-22-breakfast-with-santa/
LOCATION:RCL Branch 22\, 1240 Woodbine Ave.\, Toronto
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://d28bcn7yu97icd.cloudfront.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/16152036/Breakfast-with-Santa-2026-scaled.jpg
END:VEVENT
