SUMMARY:Advent Organ Recital
DESCRIPTION:Christine Hanson\, Organ\nCome in from the cold and listen to beautiful seasonal music – Advent chorales\, Christmas Carols and a wide range of music from Bach\, Brahms\, Vierne and Dupré.\nFreewill offering\, $20 suggested. Cookies\, tea and coffee to follow. All welcome.
