SUMMARY:Carolling in the Park
DESCRIPTION:Sing along with the Salvation Army Band and choirs at this popular annual event held in Glen Stewart Park between Queen Street and the Glen Manor bridge. The evening also includes refreshments and a special visitor! Dress warmly and bring a flashlight. Donations can be made at www.scarboroughcitadel.ca (specify “Carolling in the Park”). Info: David Breech 416-578-0656
URL:https://beachmetro.com/event/carolling-in-the-park-3/
LOCATION:Glen Stewart Park (south of Glen Manor bridge)
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://d28bcn7yu97icd.cloudfront.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/16082755/Carolling-in-the-Park-2x4-Ad.jpg
